    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d111">

                <pb facs="0222" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg142"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September 16,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Crown Prince called to-day to express his own and King’s condolence. King of
                    Greece personally, Empress Dowager of Russia through minister, request me to
                    convey sympathy to Mrs. McKinley, Government, and people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
